  "id": "genital",
  "term": "genital",
  "definition": "In this context, genital refers to the genital area of the body as the site affected by psoriasis and related symptoms. When psoriasis involves this area, it can also affect sexual activity, intimacy, body exposure, and communication about concerns.",
